    "turn_text": "No, I hope so. And you'd mentioned, you know, judges, you were obviously the chairman of the Senate Judiciary Committee during Supreme Court Justice Brett Kavanaugh's confirmation hearing. I could tell the way he was being treated and the character assassination directed towards him really bothered you. What do you think bothered you the most about it? You know, is there anything you can give us behind the scenes or kind of what was going through your mind during all of that?",
