    "turn_text": "You know, throughout the years, well, you know, we just talked about what they did to Brett Kavanaugh, and they'd left it to Brett Kavanaugh, the character assassination, the false allegations that they waged against him. We're seeing the government just become more weaponized against people, you know, what they're doing to Donald Trump. I know you've been investigating the anti-Catholic memo that came from that Richmond FBI field office. Has the government become more weaponized against Americans? And if so, why do you think that is?",
